AYED ARITHMETIC DOES NOT REPRODUCE: 'E_0 = 0.782/0.1883 approx 4.155 MeV' \u2014 the printed division gives 4.1529, not 4.155. The RESULT is right (the witness has E0_MeV = 4.154925) because it was computed from Q = 0.7823334 and |Delta net| = 0.18829062; it is the rounded display that fails to reproduce it. Proposed: quote 0.78233/0.18829. (5) CIRCULARITY, stated as a verification: 'The six terms sum exactly to Q_beta.' E_0 is DEFINED as Q_beta/|Delta net| and Delta net is by the block's own linearity clause the sum of the six coefficient differences, so sum_i Delta_i E_0 = Q_beta identically. That is the definition unfolded, not a check, and it should not be presented as one. Related: 'Untyped composition yields net approx 1.506. The CODATA proton net is approx 0.999. Typed crossings close this gap.' \u2014 CODATA measures masses, not 'nets'; 0.999 is a target, and the typed-crossing shift h_A is introduced to reach it, landing on 0.9991. That is the shape of a fit and should be labelled per the production-vs-exploratory discipline. Two lesser notes: the bold banner '**Full derivation.**' is followed by three summary sentences that derive nothing (the dangling-banner pattern); and the block says 'CODATA 2022' while its witness carries CODATA-2018 masses (m_p = 938.27208816 against the 2022 value 938.27208943). The witness's own auditOnly pointer, docs/audits/categorical-vs-fitted-q-decay-ba.md, does not exist.","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:l00","model":null,"at":"2026-08-22","stale":false,"history":2},{"id":"trap-thesis-restatement","group":"Voice","result":"pass","severity":null,"notes":"no trap of this class; full-context read","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:l00","model":null,"at":"2026-08-22","stale":false,"history":2},{"id":"trap-triples","group":"Voice","result":"pass","severity":null,"notes":"no trap of this class; full-context read","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:l00","model":null,"at":"2026-08-22","stale":false,"history":2},{"id":"voice-agent-speak","gro